</span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"d506b73ecaab7431\" href=\"?note=d506b73ecaab7431\" title=\"72-df-arithmetic-minimization-collection\">72-df-arithmetic-minimization-collection</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"0e5e75be5dd53241\" href=\"?note=0e5e75be5dd53241\" title=\"72-df-i-delta-0\">72-df-i-delta-0</a></span></div>"},{"key":"chapter","html":"II"},{"key":"source_edition","html":"Buss (ed.), Handbook of Proof Theory, Elsevier, 1998"},{"key":"source_location","html":"Ch.II Definition1.2.3, print84/PDF96"},{"key":"source_kind","html":"source-based-local-formalization"},{"key":"verification_status","html":"source-statement-and-local-contract-reviewed; not-machine-checked"},{"key":"proof_status","html":"all six source fragments and shared base checked"},{"key":"eligible_as_verified_dependency","html":"false"},{"key":"created","html":"2026-10-22"},{"key":"revision_round","html":"2026-10-22-expansion"},{"key":"review_2026_10_22_expansion","html":"补齐已引用上游的精确显示签名"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>基础 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"Q^{\\le},I\\Delta_0\">\\(Q^{\\le},I\\Delta_0\\)</span> 取 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"0e5e75be5dd53241\" href=\"?note=0e5e75be5dd53241\" title=\"72-df-i-delta-0\">72-df-i-delta-0</a>，归纳模式取 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"3e0a54fcdc8782f1\" href=\"?note=3e0a54fcdc8782f1\" title=\"72-df-bounded-induction-schemes\">72-df-bounded-induction-schemes</a>，普通层级与最小数、收集模式取 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-7\" data-note=\"3fd59a2f2c3a81c3\" href=\"?note=3fd59a2f2c3a81c3\" title=\"72-df-first-order-arithmetic-hierarchy\">72-df-first-order-arithmetic-hierarchy</a>、<a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-8\" data-note=\"d506b73ecaab7431\" href=\"?note=d506b73ecaab7431\" title=\"72-df-arithmetic-minimization-collection\">72-df-arithmetic-minimization-collection</a>。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"n\\in\\omega\">\\(n\\in\\omega\\)</span>。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{PA}_{\\le}\">\\(\\mathsf{PA}_{\\le}\\)</span> 是本语言的完整归纳版本，不与本册另一套两类变量语法中的 PA 公理集合字面识别。</li>\n<li>上述归纳模式精确记为 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Phi\\text{-}\\mathrm{IND}\">\\(\\Phi\\text{-}\\mathrm{IND}\\)</span>，沿用同一语言的 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{IND}_x(A)\">\\(\\mathrm{IND}_x(A)\\)</span>。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\begin{aligned}\nI\\mathsf\\Sigma_n&amp;:=Q^{\\le}\\cup(\\mathsf\\Sigma_n^a\\text{-}\\mathrm{IND}),&amp;\nI\\mathsf\\Pi_n&amp;:=Q^{\\le}\\cup(\\mathsf\\Pi_n^a\\text{-}\\mathrm{IND}),\\\\\nL\\mathsf\\Sigma_n&amp;:=I\\Delta_0\\cup\\operatorname{MIN}(\\mathsf\\Sigma_n^a),&amp;\nL\\mathsf\\Pi_n&amp;:=I\\Delta_0\\cup\\operatorname{MIN}(\\mathsf\\Pi_n^a),\\\\\nB\\mathsf\\Sigma_n&amp;:=I\\Delta_0\\cup\\operatorname{COL}(\\mathsf\\Sigma_n^a),&amp;\nB\\mathsf\\Pi_n&amp;:=I\\Delta_0\\cup\\operatorname{COL}(\\mathsf\\Pi_n^a),\\\\\n\\mathsf{PA}_{\\le}&amp;:=Q^{\\le}\\cup(\\mathrm{Fml}_S(\\mathcal L_{\\mathrm A})\\text{-}\\mathrm{IND}).\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\begin{aligned}\nI\\mathsf\\Sigma_n&amp;:=Q^{\\le}\\cup(\\mathsf\\Sigma_n^a\\text{-}\\mathrm{IND}),&amp;\nI\\mathsf\\Pi_n&amp;:=Q^{\\le}\\cup(\\mathsf\\Pi_n^a\\text{-}\\mathrm{IND}),\\\\\nL\\mathsf\\Sigma_n&amp;:=I\\Delta_0\\cup\\operatorname{MIN}(\\mathsf\\Sigma_n^a),&amp;\nL\\mathsf\\Pi_n&amp;:=I\\Delta_0\\cup\\operatorname{MIN}(\\mathsf\\Pi_n^a),\\\\\nB\\mathsf\\Sigma_n&amp;:=I\\Delta_0\\cup\\operatorname{COL}(\\mathsf\\Sigma_n^a),&amp;\nB\\mathsf\\Pi_n&amp;:=I\\Delta_0\\cup\\operatorname{COL}(\\mathsf\\Pi_n^a),\\\\\n\\mathsf{PA}_{\\le}&amp;:=Q^{\\le}\\cup(\\mathrm{Fml}_S(\\mathcal L_{\\mathrm A})\\text{-}\\mathrm{IND}).\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>原书的 L 和 B 都以 IΔ₀ 为底，而不是仅以 Q 为底。所有系统是同一语言的句子公理集合；含 ≤ 的 PA 与其他 PA 版本的定义扩展对应须给出翻译，不能因同名就混用。n=0 时两个归纳版本均等于已有 IΔ₀。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"72-df-bounded-induction-schemes","status":"resolved","id":"3e0a54fcdc8782f1","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[72-df-bounded-induction-schemes]]","embed":false},{"target":"72-df-first-order-arithmetic-hierarchy","status":"resolved","id":"3fd59a2f2c3a81c3","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[72-df-first-order-arithmetic-hierarchy]]","embed":false},{"target":"72-df-arithmetic-minimization-collection","status":"resolved","id":"d506b73ecaab7431","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[72-df-arithmetic-minimization-collection]]","embed":false},{"target":"72-df-i-delta-0","status":"resolved","id":"0e5e75be5dd53241","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[72-df-i-delta-0]]","embed":false},{"target":"72-df-i-delta-0","status":"resolved","id":"0e5e75be5dd53241","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"基础 $Q^{\\le},I\\Delta_0$ 取 [[72-df-i-delta-0]]，归纳模式取 [[72-df-bounded-induction-schemes]]，普通层级与最小数、收集模式取 [[72-df-first-order-arithmetic-hierarchy]]、[[72-df-arithmetic-minimization-collection]]。$n\\in\\omega$。","embed":false},{"target":"72-df-bounded-induction-schemes","status":"resolved","id":"3e0a54fcdc8782f1","anchor":"ref-6","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"基础 $Q^{\\le},I\\Delta_0$ 取 [[72-df-i-delta-0]]，归纳模式取 [[72-df-bounded-induction-schemes]]，普通层级与最小数、收集模式取 [[72-df-first-order-arithmetic-hierarchy]]、[[72-df-arithmetic-minimization-collection]]。$n\\in\\omega$。","embed":false},{"target":"72-df-first-o